# 00. DOCUMENT PURPOSE

This document defines the **internal conceptual model of AEGIS**.

The Master Architecture defined the system's purpose, biological model, product boundaries, stakeholder model, operational philosophy, and high-level architecture.

This document defines the next layer:

> **What entities exist inside AEGIS, how they relate, what state they own, how state changes, and how those changes propagate through the system.**

This document is the authoritative foundation for:

- User Flow Architecture
