# 146. CANONICAL STATE TRANSITION EXAMPLE

A signal appears.

### Step 1

```text
ObservationReceived
```

State:

```text
Observation = RECEIVED
```

### Step 2

Detection identifies a meaningful deviation.

```text
SignalDetected
```

State:

```text
