```

### Step 3

User acknowledges it.

```text
SignalAcknowledged
```

State:

```text
Signal = ACKNOWLEDGED
```

### Step 4

User creates an event.

```text
EventCreated
```

State:

```text
Event = OPEN
```

### Step 5

Evidence is added.

```text
EvidenceAdded
```

### Step 6

Assessment is produced.

```text
AssessmentCreated
```

### Step 7

Assessment is reviewed.

```text
AssessmentPublished
```

### Step 8

A response is proposed.

```text
ResponseProposed
```

### Step 9

Responsible authority approves it.

```text
ResponseApproved
```

### Step 10

Action begins.

```text
ActionStarted
```

### Step 11

Action finishes.

```text
ActionCompleted
```

### Step 12

Outcome is assessed.

```text
VerificationStarted
```

### Step 13

Outcome is verified.

```text
ResponseVerified
```

### Step 14

Recovery begins.

```text
RecoveryStarted
```

### Step 15

Recovery completes.

```text
RecoveryCompleted
```

### Step 16

Event closes.

```text
EventResolved
```

### Step 17

Institutional memory is created.

```text
MemoryCreated
```

This is the canonical AEGIS closed loop.

